    "body": "Demo: https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/12199\r\n\r\nIt seems WebKit/Chromium/Gecko don't honor CSS 2.2 wrt the above-quoted text about where the baseline should be. (WebKit and Chromium also use the *first* line instead of the last line for multi-line buttons, but that's a separate issue.)",
